== 3. what the wave can settle, and what this log cannot ==
   The dump is full hierarchy from time zero with SVA, so it carries rvfi_valid, rvfi_ext_irq_valid, the record
   fields, both pipeline arrays in every element and the writeback terms: enough for rtl-arch's four steps,
   including which alignment this run took. This log records only that the run happened and matched; the
   cycle-level answer is rtl-arch's to publish from the wave.
